\newlabel{tab:refit}{{8}{11}{SGD refit on all 100\,836 observed ratings with the best combination ($k = 2$, $\lambda = 0.01$, $\gamma = 0.01$). Total drop in RMSE: 2.9080 (79.6\%); run time 52.7\,s}{table.8}{}}
